   "id": "math.divide-rationals",
   "name": "Dividing",
   "requires": [
    "math.multiply-rationals"
   ],
   "explain": {
    "en": {
     "text": "Dividing by a fraction asks how many of it fit. To divide, multiply by the reciprocal of the divisor: a/b ÷ c/d = a/b × d/c. Same signs give a positive quotient; different signs give a negative one."
    },
    "am": {
     "text": "በክፍልፋይ ማካፈል ስንቱ እንደሚገባ ይጠይቃል። ለማካፈል በአካፋዩ ተገላቢጦሽ አባዛ። ተመሳሳይ ምልክት አዎንታዊ፣ የተለያየ ምልክት አሉታዊ ድርሻ ይሰጣል።",
     "machine": true
    }
   },
